  kind: 1
  title: "\u0110\xEAm nh\xE0 \u2014 ng\xE0y 12 (th\u01B0 gi\xE3n)"
  intro: "\xD4n ki\u1EC3u chill: tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi sai c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng sao. S\xE1ng
    mai tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp m\u1EDBi \"h\u01A1i\" g\u1EAFt h\u01A1n."
  questions:
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 12] Ch\u1ECDn c\xE2u 'tri\u1EBFt h\u1ECDc'
      \u0111\xFAng nh\u1EA5t cho sinh vi\xEAn:"
    options:
    - "T\xF4i ng\u1EE7 s\u1EDBm \u0111\u1EC3 mai d\u1EADy s\u1EDBm (n\xF3i t\u1EEB
      2h s\xE1ng)"
    - "T\xF4i kh\xF4ng tr\xEC ho\xE3n, t\xF4i ch\u1EC9 t\u1ED1i \u01B0u\u2026 th\u1EDDi
      gian t\u01B0\u01A1ng lai"
    - "T\xF4i l\xE0m xong h\u1EBFt, ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 ch\u01B0a b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u"
    - "T\xF4i h\u1ECDc b\u1EB1ng tr\u1EF1c gi\xE1c (tr\u1EF1c gi\xE1c b\u1EA3o ng\u1EE7)"
    correctIndex: 2
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 12] T\u1EA1i sao highlight m\xE0u v\xE0ng
      l\u1EA1i 'd\u1EC5 nh\u1EDB'?"
    options:
    - "V\xEC n\xE3o th\xEDch m\xE0u x\xE1m c\u1EE7a th\u1EF1c t\u1EA1i"
    - "V\xEC highlighter h\u1EBFt m\u1EF1c nhanh n\xEAn n\xE3o bu\u1ED3n qu\xEAn"
    - "V\xEC gi\xE1o vi\xEAn c\u0169ng th\xEDch v\xE0ng"
    - "V\xEC \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 skill skin premium"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 12] B\u1EA1n '\xF4n' b\u1EB1ng c\xE1ch
      n\xE0o sau \u0111\xE2y l\xE0\u2026 t\u1EC7 nh\u01B0ng th\u1EADt?"
    options:
    - "\u0110\u1ECDc l\u1EA1i d\xF2ng \u0111\u1EA7u slide 40 l\u1EA7n"
    - "K\u1EC3 l\u1EA1i b\xE0i cho b\u1EA1n c\xF9ng ph\xF2ng\u2026 \u0111ang ng\u1EE7"
    - "Thu \xE2m gi\u1ECDng m\xECnh r\u1ED3i kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD nghe l\u1EA1i"
    - "T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EC1u c\xF3 th\u1EC3 x\u1EA3y ra"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 12] N\u1EBFu GPA l\xE0 boss game, v\u0169
      kh\xED meta l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "\u0110i h\u1ECDc \u0111\xFAng gi\u1EDD + n\u1ED9p b\xE0i \u0111\xFAng h\u1EA1n"
    - Skin laptop RGB
    - "Nick name 'tryhard' tr\xEAn Discord"
    - "\u1EA2nh avatar c\xFA \u0111\xEAm"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 12] M\u1ED9t 'nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 ph\u1EE5'
      h\u1EE3p l\xFD t\u1ED1i nay l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "D\u1ECDn b\xE0n (\u0111\u1EC3 mai l\u1EA1i b\u1EEBa)"
    - "T\u01B0\u1EDBi c\xE2y\u2026 tr\xEAn wallpaper"
    - "S\u1EAFp x\u1EBFp file Desktop th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t file t\xEAn 'sau n\xE0y'"
    - "Backup d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u (\xFD th\u1EE9c)"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
